# Commit and push (this repo)

When the user asks to **commit**, **push**, or **commit and push**:

1. Follow `.cursor/skills/commit-push-master/SKILL.md` exactly.
2. After staging, run `.cursor/skills/commit-push-master/scripts/commit-push-master.ps1` — do not invent alternate git flows.
3. **Never** create a feature branch or pull request for routine commits in this repository.
4. Push only to `origin/master`.
